WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.367
You're here. You made it.
-[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.834
-Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:09.400
Well, guys, today is
Cyber Monday.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.234
-[ Cheers ]
-Yes.

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:13.801
It is the day when millions of
people shop online,

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.467
so basically Monday.

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:18.601
Everyone shops online.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.067
Seriously, I haven't been to
a store since "Avatar 1."

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:22.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.734
Yep, Cyber Monday is a great way
to get ahead of

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:27.734
your holiday shopping, and then
every gas station gift card rack

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.033
is like, "We'll see you on
the 24th, alright."

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:31.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.000
Yep, it's Cyber Monday,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.400
the busiest online shopping day
of the year.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.901
-Yeah. Yeah, I can't believe
I had to come to work today.

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.200
-What's that, Tariq?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.567
-I observe Cyber Monday.

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.367
It's very important to me.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.400
I think I should get it off.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.334
-Tariq, we've never taken off
for Cyber Monday.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.167
It's not a real holiday.
-No, no.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:53.467
It says it right here
in my contract.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:57.234
I get to take off
for the holidays I observe.

00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:58.667
-What are those?

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.400
-Cyber Monday.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.601
Toyota-thon.

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:02.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.801
Happy Honda Days.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.133
Prime Day, both summer and fall.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.734
Shark Week.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.167
The Lexus December to Remember.

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:12.701
4/20.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:15.300
Chevy End of Summer
Clearance Events.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.868
Walk About Wednesdays
at Outback Steakhouse.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.067
The last day in April so I can
post that meme of

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:23.801
Justin Timberlake singing
♪ It's gonna be May ♪

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:26.601
-[ Laughter ]
-Oh, July 4th. May the 4th.

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:27.767
Actually, I'll just take off
the fourth

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:29.300
of every month to be safe.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.701
Whenever a new "Yellowstone"
spin-off comes out.

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.367
Presidents' Day.

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:34.667
Vice Presidents' Day.

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:36.000
Speaker of the House Day.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.100
Free Cone Day at Dairy Queen.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.901
Free Cone Day at Ben &amp; Jerry's.

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.801
Free Cone Day at Haagen-Dazs.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.734
David Cone Day
at Yankee Stadium.

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:49.100
Cinco de Mayo as well as seis,
siete and ocho de Mayo.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.834
Most Thursdays.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:52.968
The Hallmark Channel's
Countdown to Christmas.

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:55.234
-[ Laughter ]
-The anniversary of that time

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.334
Fabio was riding the roller
coaster and he got hit

00:01:57.334 --> 00:01:59.567
in the face with a bird.
-[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:02.767
-And of course
my entire birthday month.

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:04.434
You cool with that?

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:06.300
-Sure.
Take off all the days you want.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.567
-Great. See you in 2024, buddy.

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:09.868
-Alright, Tariq.

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:14.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.968
Got a lot of --
-Had his suitcase ready.

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:18.934
-Got a lot of stickers
on his suitcase.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:21.033
-He travels the world.

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:24.234
-Well, guys, this is our first
show back since Thanksgiving.

00:02:24.234 --> 00:02:25.467
Did everyone have
a nice holiday?

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:27.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:30.334
I'm happy. Thanks.
I'm glad you did.

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:32.434
Do you ever invite people over
for Thanksgiving who end up

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:34.200
bringing their weird friends
with them?

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.968
Apparently, that's what Kanye
did to former President Trump.

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:38.701
-[ Laughter ]
-Did you guys see this?

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:41.434
Trump had dinner at Mar-a-Lago
with Kanye West

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:44.434
and a well-known
white supremacist.

00:02:44.434 --> 00:02:47.200
Seriously, you know these are
crazy times when Trump is only

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.367
the third most problematic
person at the table.

00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:51.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.834
Meanwhile, President Biden and
his family spent Thanksgiving

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:56.133
in Nantucket where they
reportedly talked about whether

00:02:56.133 --> 00:02:58.734
Biden should run
for a second term.

00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:00.400
Yeah, it's just like
your Thanksgiving.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.133
Everyone spent the whole time
talking about whether or not

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:04.467
to go back for seconds.
-[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:05.968
-It was a pretty intense
conversation.

00:03:05.968 --> 00:03:07.501
Let's just say there were
a lot of words

00:03:07.501 --> 00:03:08.767
that rhyme with Nantucket.

00:03:08.767 --> 00:03:10.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.634 --> 00:03:12.133
And I saw that while he was
in Nantucket,

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:15.200
Biden did some Black Friday
shopping.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.367
You know Biden had to get his
shopping done on Black Friday

00:03:17.367 --> 00:03:18.901
because there was no way
he was figuring out

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:20.400
how to buy stuff on
Cyber Monday.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.701
He's like,
"What's my password again?

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:25.968
Whipper snappers?"

00:03:25.968 --> 00:03:27.634
Oh, and everyone's
talking about this.

00:03:27.634 --> 00:03:30.701
while Biden was on vacation,
he took a selfie with some kids.

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:32.567
Did you see this?
Some kids were looking through

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:34.501
