00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.467
Look at this.

00:03:38.467 --> 00:03:46.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:50.133
It looks like the kind of photo
they analyze on "Ghost Hunters."

00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:52.033
You know. Is he real?

00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:54.267
Can we see that again?
Do you have that photo?

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:57.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.834 --> 00:04:00.200
It looks like a poster for the
second season of "The Watcher."

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.434 --> 00:04:06.133
Some entertainment news, this is
